WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.234 --> 00:00:06.739
What does it take
to save a child in Africa?

00:00:06.772 --> 00:00:09.308
To save them
from the violence?

00:00:09.341 --> 00:00:13.013 align:end size:94% position:94%
To save them from becoming
a child soldier?

00:00:14.713 --> 00:00:18.351
What if I told you
that all it took

00:00:18.384 --> 00:00:21.054
was just one beard?

00:00:21.087 --> 00:00:22.822
For the price
of one costume beard,

00:00:22.855 --> 00:00:26.359
you can save a child
from becoming another statistic,

00:00:26.392 --> 00:00:28.327
another warlord's pawn.

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:30.196 align:start position:0%
Be safe.

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:36.369
That's right.

00:00:36.402 --> 00:00:39.205
Just one beard.

00:00:39.238 --> 00:00:42.475
And for a little more,
you can get him a cane.

00:00:42.508 --> 00:00:45.344
[inspirational music]

00:00:45.377 --> 00:00:46.179
[music stops]

00:00:50.616 --> 00:00:51.584
[door closes]

00:00:51.617 --> 00:00:53.119
We are here for the children!

00:00:53.152 --> 00:00:56.122
[suspenseful music]

00:00:56.155 --> 00:00:58.758
♪ ♪

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:03.763
[upbeat jazz music playing]

00:01:13.806 --> 00:01:15.308
These are all old people.

00:01:15.341 --> 00:01:16.776
We are wasting our time.

00:01:18.344 --> 00:01:19.479
Wait!

00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:24.150
[dramatic music]

00:01:24.183 --> 00:01:31.791
♪ ♪

00:01:37.763 --> 00:01:39.465 align:start position:0%
[whistles]

00:01:39.498 --> 00:01:40.833
[engine starts]

00:01:40.866 --> 00:01:43.402 align:start position:0%
Go, go!

00:01:43.435 --> 00:01:46.205 line:0%
[inspirational music]

00:01:46.238 --> 00:01:50.243 line:0%
♪ ♪

00:01:50.276 --> 00:01:51.811 line:0%
Call today.

00:01:51.844 --> 00:01:59.185 line:0%
♪ ♪

